msgstr "Platform Description - Organization Admin"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:19
msgid "本文件說明 BeakPlatform 的帳號等級、角色、權限架構與安全機制，供企業管理員參考。"
msgstr ""
"This document describes the account level of BeakPlatform, Role, "
"permission structure and security mechanism, for reference by "
"Organization Admin."

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:23
msgid "帳號等級與角色"
msgstr "Account level and Role"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:24
msgid "權限管理"
msgstr "Permission Management"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:25
msgid "安全機制"
msgstr "security mechanism"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:26
msgid "名詞對照"
msgstr "noun contrast"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:35
msgid "帳號等級 (User Type)"
msgstr "Account Level (User Type)"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:36
msgid "每個帳號有且只有一個等級，決定此人在系統中的基本身分與可見範圍。"
msgstr ""
"Each account has one and only one level, which determines the person's "
"basic status and visibility in the system."

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:49
#, python-format
msgid "平台維運人員，隸屬特殊企業 %(SYSTEM_ORG_CODE)s。管理所有企業、主機設定、模組商店。不參與各企業內的業務操作。"
msgstr ""
"Platform maintenance personnel, subordinate to special Organization "
"%(SYSTEM_ORG_CODE)s. Manage all Organization, console settings, and "
"module stores. Do not participate in the business operations within each "
"Organization."

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:54
msgid "企業內最高管理者。管理本企業的組織架構、帳號、角色、選單、模組設定。天生持有本企業內所有非系統級權限。"
msgstr ""
"The top manager in Organization. Manage the organizational structure, "
"account, Role, Menu, and module settings of this Organization. Naturally "
"holds all non-system level permissions in this Organization."

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:59
msgid "企業內一般使用者。可見範圍由管理員透過選單授權和角色指派決定。"
msgstr ""
"General users in Organization. The visible range is determined by the "
"administrator through Menu authorization and Role assignment."

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:64
msgid "非本企業人員（供應商、顧問等）。可見範圍最小，由管理員明確開放。"
msgstr ""
"Non-Organization personnel (suppliers, consultants, etc.). The visible "
"range is the smallest and is explicitly opened by the administrator."

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:70
msgid "等級之間互相獨立，不是「企業管理員 = 企業成員 + 更多權限」的關係。各等級看到的選單和功能由管理員分別配置。"
msgstr ""
"The levels are independent of each other and are not related to "
"\"Organization Admin = Employee + more permissions\". The Menu and "
"functions seen at each level are configured separately by the "
"administrator."

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:75
