"(such as: create, edit, delete)"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:240
msgid "常見問題："
msgstr "FAQ:"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:240
msgid "如果企業成員反映「選單看得到但點進去沒權限」，通常是步驟 1 通過但步驟 3 或 4 未配置。請至 /access/ 檢查衝突偵測結果。"
msgstr ""
"If a member reports \"the menu is visible but access is denied\", step 1 "
"passed while step 3 or 4 is not configured. Check the conflict detection "
"results in /access/."

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:245
msgid "企業管理員的天生權限"
msgstr "The natural authority of Organization Admin"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:246
msgid "企業管理員（ORG_ADMIN）天生持有本企業內所有「企業級」和「模組級」權限，無需透過角色指派。"
msgstr ""
"Organization Admin (ORG_ADMIN) naturally holds all \"Organization level\""
" and \"module level\" permissions in this Organization, and does not need"
" to be assigned through Role."

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:247
msgid "這代表："
msgstr "This means:"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:249
msgid "企業管理員不需要被加入任何角色就能操作所有企業內功能"
msgstr ""
"Organization Admin does not need to be added to any Role to operate all "
"functions in Organization"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:250
msgid "在 /access/ 的衝突偵測中，僅授權給 ORG_ADMIN 的選單不會被標記為缺少 RBAC 權限"
msgstr ""
"In /access/ conflict detection, menus granted only to ORG_ADMIN are not "
"flagged as missing RBAC permissions"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:251
msgid "但「系統級」權限仍保留給系統管理員，企業管理員無法取得"
