"However, \"system-level\" permissions are still reserved for System "
"Administrator, and Organization Admin cannot obtain them."

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:256
msgid "權限管理建議流程"
msgstr "Permissions Management Recommendation Process"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:257
msgid "新增一個需要權限控制的功能時，建議依以下順序操作："
msgstr ""
"When adding a function that requires permission control, it is "
"recommended to operate in the following order:"

