msgstr "-- Create or adjust the menu structure"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:260
msgid "-- 設定選單可見性與角色門檻"
msgstr "-- Configure menu visibility and role thresholds"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:261
msgid "-- 建立或選擇角色，指派角色給帳號"
msgstr "--Create or select Role and assign Role to the account"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:262
msgid "-- 為角色配置所需的 RBAC 權限並檢查衝突"
msgstr "-- Configure required RBAC permissions for roles and check for conflicts"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:274
msgid "安全防護架構"
msgstr "Security protection architecture"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:275
msgid "平台採用多層防護設計，每一層獨立運作，即使某一層被繞過，後續層仍然保護系統。"
msgstr ""
"The platform adopts a multi-layer protection design, with each layer "
"operating independently. Even if one layer is bypassed, subsequent layers"
" will still protect the system."

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:280
msgid "層"
msgstr "layer"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:282
msgid "作用"
msgstr "function"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:283
msgid "未通過的結果"
