msgid "網頁角色守衛"
msgstr "Web page Role guard"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:302
msgid "驗證使用者是否持有進入該頁面所需的角色"
msgstr "Verify whether the user holds the Role required to enter this page"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:303
msgid "強制登出並記錄稽核日誌"
msgstr "Force logout and record audit logs"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:307
msgid "資源權限檢查"
msgstr "Resource permission check"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:308
msgid "驗證使用者是否有權執行特定操作（讀取、建立、編輯、刪除）"
msgstr ""
"Verify that the user has permission to perform a specific operation "
"(read, create, edit, delete)"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:309
msgid "403 拒絕操作"
msgstr "403 Operation refused"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:313
msgid "企業資料隔離"
msgstr "Organization data isolation"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:314
msgid "每筆資料查詢都強制加入企業識別碼過濾，A 企業看不到 B 企業的資料"
msgstr ""
"Every data query is forced to add the Organization identification code "
"filter. A Organization cannot see the data of B Organization."

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:315
msgid "資料不可見"
msgstr "Data is not visible"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:322
msgid "帳號安全"
msgstr "Account Security"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:326
msgid "機制"
msgstr "mechanism"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:332
msgid "預設管理員帳號"
msgstr "Default administrator account"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:333
msgid "企業建立時自動產生 admin 帳號。建議盡快建立個人管理員帳號後停用此預設帳號，儀表板會持續提醒。"
msgstr ""
"The admin account is automatically generated when Organization is "
"created. It is recommended to create a personal administrator account as "
"soon as possible and then deactivate this default account. The dashboard "
"will continue to remind you."

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:336
msgid "帳號停用 vs 刪除"
msgstr "Account deactivation vs deletion"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:337
msgid "停用（is_active=false）：帳號無法登入但資料保留，可隨時恢復。刪除（is_deleted=true）：軟刪除，資料保留但完全不可見。"
msgstr ""
"Deactivated (is_active=false): The account cannot be logged in but the "
"data is retained and can be restored at any time. Delete "
"(is_deleted=true): Soft delete, the data is retained but completely "
"invisible."

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:340
msgid "URL 安全識別碼"
msgstr "URL security code"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:341
msgid "所有資源在 URL 中使用隨機產生的安全識別碼（secure_code），而非可猜測的流水號，防止未授權的資料存取。"
msgstr ""
"All resources use randomly generated security identifiers (secure_code) "
"in URLs instead of guessable serial numbers to prevent unauthorized data "
"access."

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:344
#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:454
msgid "稽核日誌"
msgstr "Audit log"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:345
msgid "重要操作（登入、權限變更、資料異動）自動記錄稽核日誌，供事後追溯。"
msgstr ""
"Important operations (login, permission changes, data changes) are "
"automatically recorded in audit logs for subsequent tracing."

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:352
msgid "模組存取控制"
msgstr "module access control"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:353
msgid "模組（如表單流程、子系統開發）的存取受額外控制："
msgstr ""
"Access to modules (such as form processes, subsystem development) is "
"subject to additional controls:"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:357
msgid "控制層"
msgstr "control layer"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:363
msgid "合約驗證"
msgstr "Contract verification"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:364
msgid "企業必須持有該模組的有效合約才能使用。合約過期後模組不可見。"
msgstr ""
"Organization must hold a valid Contract of this module to use it. After "
"Contract expires, the module will not be visible."

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:367
msgid "模組 ACL"
msgstr "Module ACL"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:368
msgid "企業管理員在 /admin/module-users/ 設定哪些企業成員可存取哪些模組。企業管理員本身自動擁有所有模組的存取權。"
msgstr ""
"Organization Admin sets which Employee can access which modules in /admin"
"/module-users/. Organization Admin itself automatically has access rights"
" to all modules."

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:382
msgid "名詞對照表"
msgstr "Noun comparison table"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:387
msgid "名詞"
msgstr "noun"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:388
msgid "英文"
msgstr "English"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:394
msgid "帳號等級"
msgstr "Account Level"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:396
msgid "帳號的基本身分分類：系統管理員、企業管理員、企業成員、外部廠商"
msgstr ""
"Basic classification of accounts: System Administrator, Organization "
"Admin, Employee, External Vendor"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:401
msgid "可被指派給帳號的職務或功能身分，一個帳號可持有多個角色"
msgstr ""
"Duty or functional identity that can be assigned to an account, and one "
"account can hold multiple Role"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:404
msgid "角色繼承"
msgstr "Role inheritance"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:406
msgid "子角色自動擁有父角色的所有權限"
msgstr "The child Role automatically has all the permissions of the parent Role"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:411
msgid "可被授予角色的具體操作能力（如：檢視表單範本、編輯流程）"
msgstr ""
"Can be granted the specific operational capabilities of Role (such as: "
"viewing form templates, editing processes)"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:416
msgid "基於角色的存取控制。權限不直接授予帳號，而是授予角色，帳號透過持有角色間接獲得權限"
msgstr ""
"Access control based on Role. Permissions are not granted directly to the"
" account, but to Role. The account obtains permissions indirectly by "
"holding Role."

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:421
msgid "控制哪些帳號等級能看到哪些選單項目"
msgstr "Control which account levels can see which Menu projects"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:426
msgid "控制存取特定選單頁面需要持有哪些角色"
msgstr "Control which Roles are required to access a specific Menu page"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:431
msgid "選單項目設定的最低權限代碼，使用者必須持有該權限才能看到選單"
msgstr ""
"The lowest permission code set by the Menu project. Users must have this "
"permission to see Menu"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:434
msgid "企業隔離"
msgstr "Organization isolation"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:436
msgid "不同企業的資料完全隔離，互不可見"
msgstr ""
"The data of different Organization are completely isolated and invisible "
"to each other."

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:439
msgid "安全識別碼"
msgstr "Security ID"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:441
msgid "系統內部用於識別資源的隨機字串，取代可猜測的流水號"
msgstr ""
"A random string used within the system to identify resources, replacing "
"guessable serial numbers."

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:446
msgid "掛載在平台上的獨立功能單元（如表單流程、子系統開發），透過合約授權使用"
msgstr ""
"Independent functional units (such as form processes and subsystem "
"development) mounted on the platform can be used through Contract "
"authorization"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:451
msgid "企業與模組之間的授權關係，包含有效期限"
msgstr ""
"The authorization relationship between Organization and the module, "
"including the validity period"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:456
msgid "系統自動記錄的操作歷史，用於事後追溯與合規"
msgstr ""
"The system automatically records the operation history for subsequent "
"traceability and compliance."

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:459
msgid "衝突偵測"
msgstr "conflict detection"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:461
msgid "/access/ 中的功能，自動檢查權限配置是否有遺漏或矛盾"
msgstr ""
"A feature in /access/ that automatically checks the permission "
"configuration for gaps or contradictions"

