msgstr "Basic rules"

#: ../modules/form_workflow/templates/modules/form_workflow/mappings_list.html:398
msgid "表單同一時間只能與一個流程配對。"
msgstr "A form can only be paired with one workflow at a time."

#: ../modules/form_workflow/templates/modules/form_workflow/mappings_list.html:399
msgid "一個流程可被多個表單配對。"
msgstr "A workflow can be paired with multiple forms."

#: ../modules/form_workflow/templates/modules/form_workflow/mappings_list.html:400
msgid "同一組配對，限制單一發行版本。"
msgstr "Same set of pairings, limited to a single publish."

#: ../modules/form_workflow/templates/modules/form_workflow/mappings_list.html:401
msgid "同一組配對，發佈新的發行之後，舊版的表單流程若已發動，會從配對庫的舊版設計繼續完成流程，不會與新版發行衝突。"
msgstr ""
"For the same set of pairings, after a new publish is publishd, if the old"
" version of the form workflow has been activated, the workflow will "
"continue to be completed from the old version of the design in the "
"matching library, and will not conflict with the new publish."

#: ../modules/form_workflow/templates/modules/form_workflow/mappings_list.html:402
msgid "基於上一項，如果企業原則需要中斷舊版流程，請由企業級管理員強制中斷（可能需自行通知申請人），並於設計時考慮逾期簽核的時效不宜太久。"
msgstr ""
"Based on the previous item, if enterprise principles require the "
"interruption of the old version of the workflow, please have the "
"enterprise-level administrator force the interruption (the applicant may "
"need to be notified themselves), and consider during design that the time"
" limit for overdue approval should not be too long."

#: ../modules/form_workflow/templates/modules/form_workflow/mappings_list.html:406
msgid "自動配對規則"
msgstr "Automatic pairing rules"

#: ../modules/form_workflow/templates/modules/form_workflow/mappings_list.html:408
msgid "用名稱配對，當新建立流程時，如果沒有同名稱的表單，儲存新流程時會建立同名稱的表單且自動配對（因為流程需要表單發動）。"
msgstr ""
"Use name matching. When a new workflow is created, if there is no form "
"with the same name, a form with the same name will be created and "
"automatically paired when the new workflow is saved (because the workflow"
" requires the form to be activated)."

#: ../modules/form_workflow/templates/modules/form_workflow/mappings_list.html:409
msgid "再度建立同名稱的流程時（ID不同，這是合規則的），若同名稱的表單已經存在，無論如何不會自動配對（避免自動建立非預期的配對）。"
msgstr ""
"When re-creating a workflow with the same name (with different IDs, which"
" is in compliance with the rules), if a form with the same name already "
"exists, it will not be automatically paired anyway (to avoid automatic "
"creation of unexpected pairings)."

#: ../modules/form_workflow/templates/modules/form_workflow/mappings_list.html:413
msgid "人工配對"
msgstr "artificial pairing"

#: ../modules/form_workflow/templates/modules/form_workflow/mappings_list.html:415
msgid "在不違反上述規則下可順利配對，並有防呆提示。"
msgstr ""
"Pairing can be done smoothly without violating the above rules, and there"
" are foolproof tips."

#: ../modules/form_workflow/templates/modules/form_workflow/mappings_list.html:416
msgid "同一配對未發行時，直接採用設計圖發動，提供設計者可「邊改邊測試」的環境，永遠是最新版本（設計圖只有一個版本），所以修改設計後請遺忘該設計在表單中心的舊記錄，因為舊資料與新設計版本不同（未必會有明顯錯誤）。"
msgstr ""
"When the same pairing is not publishd, the design drawing is directly "
"used to launch, providing an environment where designers can \"test while"
" changing\". It will always be the latest version (there is only one "
"version of the design drawing), so after modifying the design, please "
"forget the old record of the design in the form center, because the old "
"data is different from the new design version (there may not be obvious "
"errors)."

#: ../modules/form_workflow/templates/modules/form_workflow/mappings_list.html:417
msgid "每一次發行，會從表單與流程的設計圖「複製」到發行庫，確保變更設計後在表單中心查詢舊發行的表單時，能真實呈現當時的表單與流程。"
msgstr ""
"For each publish, the design drawings of the form and workflow will be "
"\"copied\" to the publish library to ensure that after the design is "
"changed, when the old issued form is queried in the form center, the form"
" and workflow at that time can be truly displayed."

#: ../modules/form_workflow/templates/modules/form_workflow/mappings_list.html:418
msgid "基於上一項，當企業一般用戶以發行的版本運作時，設計者依然能邊修改邊測試，或另以新配對發行給指定用戶於真實環境進行封測，等設計完成後用原本的配對或新配對來發行新版本。"
msgstr ""
"Based on the previous item, when the general users of the enterprise "
"operate with the publishd version, the designer can still modify and test"
" it, or use a new pairing to publish it to designated users for closed "
"testing in the real environment. After the design is completed, use the "
"original pairing or the new pairing to publish a new version."

#: ../modules/form_workflow/templates/modules/form_workflow/mappings_list.html:422
msgid "表單權限"
msgstr "form permissions"

#: ../modules/form_workflow/templates/modules/form_workflow/mappings_list.html:424
msgid "未發行：只管理員可使用。"
msgstr "Unpublishd: only available to administrators."

#: ../modules/form_workflow/templates/modules/form_workflow/mappings_list.html:425
msgid "封測：表單權限設定給測試組人員，可用真實環境封閉測試。"
msgstr ""
"Closed test: The form permissions are set to the test team members, and "
"the real environment can be used for closed testing."

#: ../modules/form_workflow/templates/modules/form_workflow/mappings_list.html:426
msgid "公開：表單權限設定給一般用戶，企業使用環境。"
msgstr ""
"Public: The form permissions are set for general users and enterprise use"
" environment."

